     2550                           no-lock ,
     2551                 first  tmp#grp  where gds-obj.grp-name   begins tmp#grp.grp-name   no-lock ,
     2552                 first goods       where gds-obj.gds-code   = goods.gds-code  no-lock
     2553                     break
     2554                     by gds-obj.grp-name
     2555                     by goods.gds-name :
